"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So gear up, dive deep, and may your Mech legs never rust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, survival miners – the ocean is waiting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/2ebbda82bdce7ba75632bc684f37ae35.avif?t=1785404527\" width=1560 height=2266 /></span></p>",
